Dialogue: 5,0:00:05.55,0:00:07.45,Main,,0,0,0,,Parece que aterrissamos no metrô.
Dialogue: 5,0:00:09.21,0:00:10.77,Main,,0,0,0,,Cadê a Mii-chan e os garotos?
Dialogue: 5,0:00:10.77,0:00:12.39,Main,,0,0,0,,Não os vi por aqui.
Dialogue: 5,0:00:12.39,0:00:15.67,Main,,0,0,0,,Mas, no momento, precisamos\N fazer algo a respeito do Cabo.
Dialogue: 5,0:00:15.67,0:00:18.02,Main,,0,0,0,,Deve haver uma base temporária lá em cima.
Dialogue: 5,0:00:18.59,0:00:21.16,Main,,0,0,0,,Ele pode ser tratado lá.
Dialogue: 5,0:00:21.16,0:00:23.02,Main,,0,0,0,,Ei, Yuu idiota!
Dialogue: 5,0:00:23.02,0:00:24.41,Main,,0,0,0,,Está aí?
Dialogue: 5,0:00:25.14,0:00:26.53,Main,,0,0,0,,Vocês estão bem?
Dialogue: 5,0:00:27.02,0:00:28.50,Main,,0,0,0,,Mas é óbvio!
Dialogue: 5,0:00:29.24,0:00:32.03,Main,,0,0,0,,Até parece que vamos morrer\N num lugar destes, imbecil.
Dialogue: 5,0:00:33.92,0:00:35.03,Main,,0,0,0,,Conseguem sair?
Dialogue: 5,0:00:36.96,0:00:38.04,Main,,0,0,0,,Sem problemas!
Dialogue: 5,0:00:38.04,0:00:41.15,Main,,0,0,0,,Então, vão na frente!
Dialogue: 5,0:00:41.15,0:00:43.58,Main,,0,0,0,,Vamos passar em um lugar.
Dialogue: 5,0:00:43.58,0:00:45.56,Main,,0,0,0,,Os encontraremos na linha de defesa!
Dialogue: 5,0:00:47.61,0:00:49.40,Main,,0,0,0,,Sim, mas...
Dialogue: 5,0:00:49.40,0:00:50.75,Main,,0,0,0,,Não se atrasem!
Dialogue: 5,0:01:36.12,0:01:37.44,Main,,0,0,0,,Que droga.
Dialogue: 5,0:01:37.44,0:01:39.58,Main,,0,0,0,,Não consegui matar o comandante.
Dialogue: 5,0:01:41.67,0:01:43.73,Main,,0,0,0,,Ah, que incrível.
Dialogue: 5,0:01:44.96,0:01:47.99,Main,,0,0,0,,Aquele golpe acabou com várias tropas.
Dialogue: 5,0:01:47.99,0:01:50.84,Main,,0,0,0,,Parece que os humanos estão \Nlutando ao seu máximo também.
Dialogue: 5,0:01:51.81,0:01:53.27,Main,,0,0,0,,Seu máximo?
Dialogue: 5,0:01:53.27,0:01:57.62,Main,,0,0,0,,A elite da unidade de\N exterminação de vampiros:
Dialogue: 5,0:01:57.62,0:01:59.57,Main,,0,0,0,,a Companhia do Demônio da Lua.
Dialogue: 5,0:02:00.63,0:02:02.16,Main,,0,0,0,,Pois bem, pessoal...
Dialogue: 5,0:02:05.19,0:02:06.73,Main,,0,0,0,,Já está tudo pronto?
Dialogue: 5,0:02:09.19,0:02:13.55,Main,,0,0,0,,Vamos esmagar esses humanos imundos.
Dialogue: 5,0:02:17.31,0:02:18.85,Main,,0,0,0,,Ei, vocês aí.
Dialogue: 5,0:02:18.85,0:02:21.20,Main,,0,0,0,,Aproveitaram a refeição?
Dialogue: 5,0:02:21.20,0:02:24.14,Main,,0,0,0,,É melhor saborearem-na, \Nporque foi a Última Ceia de vocês.
Dialogue: 5,0:02:28.70,0:02:32.53,Main,,0,0,0,,Empreste-me a sua força, \NLâmina Demoníaca Mahiru-no-Yo.
Dialogue: 5,0:02:33.75,0:02:35.40,Main,,0,0,0,,Vamos, pessoal.
Dialogue: 5,0:02:35.40,0:02:38.41,Main,,0,0,0,,Se defendermos a nossa terra,\N esta guerra será nossa.
Dialogue: 5,0:02:39.13,0:02:40.55,Main,,0,0,0,,Vamos exterminá-los.
Dialogue: 5,0:02:42.69,0:02:44.25,Main,,0,0,0,,Até o último deles.
Dialogue: 5,0:04:34.33,0:04:36.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Estão todos prontos?
Dialogue: 5,0:04:36.08,0:04:37.14,Main,,0,0,0,,Sim!
Dialogue: 5,0:04:37.79,0:04:40.44,Main,,0,0,0,,Mika-nii, Yuu-nii, estamos indo!
Dialogue: 5,0:04:41.23,0:04:42.56,Main,,0,0,0,,Tenham cuidado!
Dialogue: 5,0:04:44.07,0:04:45.42,Main,,0,0,0,,Até mais tarde.
Dialogue: 5,0:04:45.42,0:04:46.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Até mais tarde!
Dialogue: 5,0:04:47.02,0:04:49.40,Main,,0,0,0,,Almoço!\NÉ hora do almoço!
Dialogue: 5,0:04:49.40,0:04:50.94,Main,,0,0,0,,Viva, comida!
Dialogue: 5,0:04:50.94,0:04:52.41,Main,,0,0,0,,Vou comer bastante!
Dialogue: 5,0:04:52.41,0:04:55.71,Main,,0,0,0,,Ei, ei, você vai tropeçar se correr.
Dialogue: 5,0:04:58.13,0:04:59.87,Main,,0,0,0,,Ei, Yuu-chan.
Dialogue: 5,0:04:59.87,0:05:01.31,Main,,0,0,0,,Agora não.
Dialogue: 5,0:05:01.31,0:05:03.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Ei, ei, Yuu-chan!
Dialogue: 5,0:05:03.00,0:05:04.42,Main,,0,0,0,,Cala a boca!
Dialogue: 5,0:05:04.42,0:05:05.67,Main,,0,0,0,,O que você quer, Mika?
Dialogue: 5,0:05:05.67,0:05:10.68,Main,,0,0,0,,Se pudesse escapar, o que iria\N querer fazer, Yuu-chan?
Dialogue: 5,0:05:12.16,0:05:14.15,Main,,0,0,0,,E o que há para fazer?
Dialogue: 5,0:05:14.15,0:05:17.43,Main,,0,0,0,,O vírus está por todo lado e a raça\N humana está praticamente extinta.
Dialogue: 5,0:05:18.12,0:05:24.16,Main,,0,0,0,,Estou só dizendo que se pudéssemos \Nescapar lá para fora com a nossa família,
Dialogue: 5,0:05:24.16,0:05:26.42,Main,,0,0,0,,em direção a um mundo sem vampiros...
Dialogue: 5,0:05:27.25,0:05:29.07,Main,,0,0,0,,Não parece excitante?
Dialogue: 5,0:05:30.59,0:05:32.19,Main,,0,0,0,,Só nós?
Dialogue: 5,0:05:32.19,0:05:34.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Sim, como uma família.
Dialogue: 5,0:05:34.70,0:05:37.51,Main,,0,0,0,,Sim, parece excitante, mas...
Dialogue: 5,0:05:37.51,0:05:38.45,Main,,0,0,0,,Verdade?
Dialogue: 5,0:05:38.45,0:05:39.83,Main,,0,0,0,,Sim, eu acho.
Dialogue: 5,0:05:41.08,0:05:43.59,Main,,0,0,0,,Então acho que vou ter que me esforçar mais.
Dialogue: 5,0:05:44.64,0:05:47.59,Main,,0,0,0,,Não, não é nada.
Dialogue: 5,0:05:47.59,0:05:50.49,Main,,0,0,0,,Bem, tenho umas coisas para fazer.
Dialogue: 5,0:05:50.49,0:05:52.81,Main,,0,0,0,,Coisas?\NO que está armando?
Dialogue: 5,0:05:53.77,0:05:56.30,Main,,0,0,0,,Como eu disse, não é nada.
Dialogue: 5,0:05:59.43,0:06:00.72,Main,,0,0,0,,Seu esquisito.
Dialogue: 5,0:06:03.79,0:06:07.21,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Mas aquele sonho nunca se tornou realidade.
Dialogue: 5,0:06:09.44,0:06:12.61,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}O mundo aqui fora não é \Nnenhum paraíso também, Mika.
Dialogue: 5,0:06:21.78,0:06:23.37,Main,,0,0,0,,Vamos, Yuu-san?
Dialogue: 5,0:06:24.52,0:06:26.19,Main,,0,0,0,,E o Cabo?
Dialogue: 5,0:06:26.19,0:06:29.26,Main,,0,0,0,,Me disseram que ele viverá para ver outro dia.
Dialogue: 5,0:06:29.83,0:06:31.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Entendo.\NIsso é bom.
Dialogue: 5,0:06:33.01,0:06:37.66,Main,,0,0,0,,Além do mais, o tenente-coronel Guren \Ndeu uma ordem para o nosso esquadrão.
Dialogue: 5,0:06:38.41,0:06:39.77,Main,,0,0,0,,O Guren está aqui?
Dialogue: 5,0:06:41.65,0:06:44.11,Main,,0,0,0,,Mensagens foram transmitidas\N para cada um dos postos.
Dialogue: 5,0:06:50.36,0:06:54.50,Main,,0,0,0,,Ele está na interseção principal do \Nquinto distrito ao oeste de Shinjuku,
Dialogue: 5,0:06:54.50,0:06:57.05,Main,,0,0,0,,detendo a força principal dos vampiros.
Dialogue: 5,0:06:57.71,0:06:59.54,Main,,0,0,0,,Exigiu reforço imediato de nossa parte.
Dialogue: 5,0:07:00.11,0:07:01.51,Main,,0,0,0,,A força principal...
Dialogue: 5,0:07:02.07,0:07:05.71,Main,,0,0,0,,Então vamos vencer se os derrotarmos, certo?
Dialogue: 5,0:07:05.71,0:07:07.67,Main,,0,0,0,,Tenho certeza de que os \Nvampiros pensam o mesmo:
Dialogue: 5,0:07:08.53,0:07:11.51,Main,,0,0,0,,que derrotando o tenente-coronel,\N eles vão vencer.
Dialogue: 5,0:07:12.70,0:07:16.61,Main,,0,0,0,,Vamos nos apressar e nos reagrupar\N com os outros na linha de defesa.
Dialogue: 5,0:07:16.61,0:07:18.18,Main,,0,0,0,,E aí vamos para o quinto distrito.
Dialogue: 5,0:07:19.84,0:07:21.68,Main,,0,0,0,,Eu disse que é impossível!
Dialogue: 5,0:07:24.73,0:07:28.37,Main,,0,0,0,,Recebemos a ordem de enviar {\i1}todos{\i0} os homens para a linha de defesa.
Dialogue: 5,0:07:28.37,0:07:30.82,Main,,0,0,0,,Se eles conseguirem passar, Shinjuku vai desaparecer!
Dialogue: 5,0:07:30.82,0:07:33.82,Main,,0,0,0,,Nossas próprias tropas estão \Nprestes a cair também!
Dialogue: 5,0:07:34.24,0:07:36.07,Main,,0,0,0,,Temos a unidade de exterminação lá, não temos?
Dialogue: 5,0:07:36.07,0:07:41.20,Main,,0,0,0,,Só três membros, e todos são jovens!
Dialogue: 5,0:07:41.20,0:07:45.21,Main Alt,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Por outro lado, os inimigos\N têm um pelotão partidário!
Dialogue: 5,0:07:44.34,0:07:45.21,Main,,0,0,0,,Yuu-san!
Dialogue: 5,0:07:45.21,0:07:48.24,Main,,0,0,0,,É só questão de tempo até sermos derrotados.
Dialogue: 5,0:07:50.97,0:07:53.73,Main,,0,0,0,,Certo.\NVamos enviar o nosso próprio pelotão.
Dialogue: 5,0:07:53.73,0:07:55.22,Main,,0,0,0,,Qual é a—
Dialogue: 5,0:07:53.97,0:07:55.22,Main Alt,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Com licença!
Dialogue: 5,0:07:55.72,0:07:59.11,Main,,0,0,0,,Com "unidade de exterminação", você quis\N dizer a Companhia do Demônio da Lua?
Dialogue: 5,0:07:59.97,0:08:01.41,Main,,0,0,0,,Ah, não tenho certeza.
Dialogue: 5,0:08:02.04,0:08:03.33,Main,,0,0,0,,Quem são vocês?
Dialogue: 5,0:08:03.33,0:08:04.73,Main,,0,0,0,,Somos da Companhia do Demônio—
Dialogue: 5,0:08:04.73,0:08:05.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Os três que você mencionou.
Dialogue: 5,0:08:05.88,0:08:07.48,Main,,0,0,0,,Era uma garota com dois garotos?
Dialogue: 5,0:08:08.07,0:08:10.18,Main,,0,0,0,,S-Sim, isso mesmo.
Dialogue: 5,0:08:10.18,0:08:11.98,Main,,0,0,0,,Onde eles estão lutando?
Dialogue: 5,0:08:12.84,0:08:16.08,Main,,0,0,0,,No Parque Central de Shinjuku.
Dialogue: 5,0:08:16.08,0:08:17.29,Main,,0,0,0,,Vamos cuidar disso.
Dialogue: 5,0:08:17.29,0:08:20.01,Main,,0,0,0,,Envie os esquadrões para a\N linha de defesa, entendeu?
Dialogue: 5,0:08:21.01,0:08:22.87,Main,,0,0,0,,Espere, Yuu-san!
Dialogue: 5,0:08:25.51,0:08:27.52,Main,,0,0,0,,Pare e pense por um segundo!
Dialogue: 5,0:08:27.52,0:08:30.38,Main,,0,0,0,,Ainda não temos certeza de que são eles.
Dialogue: 5,0:08:30.89,0:08:34.19,Main,,0,0,0,,Não devemos agir sob suposições apressadas.
Dialogue: 5,0:08:34.19,0:08:36.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Dar apoio ao tenente-coronel\N Guren é a nossa prioridade!
Dialogue: 5,0:08:37.49,0:08:43.17,Main,,0,0,0,,Mesmo ele teria problemas contra\N a força principal do inimigo.
Dialogue: 5,0:08:43.17,0:08:46.41,Main,,0,0,0,,A linha de defesa de Shinjuku está caindo.
Dialogue: 5,0:08:46.41,0:08:50.12,Main,,0,0,0,,No momento, somos os únicos\N que podem apoiá-lo!
Dialogue: 5,0:09:38.50,0:09:41.09,Main,,0,0,0,,Droga, eles não param de aparecer.
Dialogue: 5,0:09:41.09,0:09:43.07,Main,,0,0,0,,Eu e a Mito-san vamos cobri-lo.
Dialogue: 5,0:09:43.07,0:09:45.25,Main,,0,0,0,,Você vai atrás do comandante.
Dialogue: 5,0:09:45.25,0:09:48.29,Main,,0,0,0,,Parece um plano.
Dialogue: 5,0:09:48.29,0:09:49.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Conto com você!
Dialogue: 5,0:09:55.69,0:09:58.52,Main,,0,0,0,,Isto é muito interessante.
Dialogue: 5,0:09:58.52,0:10:02.01,Main,,0,0,0,,Se pelo menos o Décimo Terceiro Progenitor,\N Crowley-kun, tivesse chegado a tempo,
Dialogue: 5,0:10:02.01,0:10:05.11,Main,,0,0,0,,as coisas teriam começado a parecer melhores.
Dialogue: 5,0:10:05.81,0:10:07.31,Main,,0,0,0,,Ah, que seja.
Dialogue: 5,0:10:07.93,0:10:09.23,Main,,0,0,0,,Lacus, Rene.
Dialogue: 5,0:10:10.07,0:10:14.09,Main,,0,0,0,,Reúnam os outros e afastem os humanos,\N exceto aquele monstro impetuoso.
Dialogue: 5,0:10:14.09,0:10:14.78,Main,,0,0,0,,Sim, senhor.
Dialogue: 5,0:10:14.78,0:10:15.95,Main,,0,0,0,,Deixe conosco.
Dialogue: 5,0:10:20.67,0:10:22.92,Main,,0,0,0,,Então, Mika-kun.
Dialogue: 5,0:10:22.92,0:10:30.22,Main,,0,0,0,,Talvez eu finalmente consiga ver você, o favorito \Nda Terceira Progenitora, Krul Tepes-chan, em ação.
Dialogue: 5,0:10:34.87,0:10:38.48,Main,,0,0,0,,Você e eu vamos matar aquele\N homem desdenhoso.
Dialogue: 5,0:10:38.48,0:10:39.31,Main,,0,0,0,,Entendeu?
Dialogue: 5,0:10:41.52,0:10:43.19,Main,,0,0,0,,Posso cuidar dele sozinho.
Dialogue: 5,0:10:43.19,0:10:45.76,Main,,0,0,0,,Ah, como o esperado.
Dialogue: 5,0:10:46.67,0:10:50.64,Main,,0,0,0,,Ele vai se arrepender de \Napontar sua espada contra mim.
Dialogue: 5,0:10:50.64,0:10:51.77,Main,,0,0,0,,Venha, minha espada.
Dialogue: 5,0:10:54.29,0:10:56.81,Main,,0,0,0,,Nossa, que assustador.
Dialogue: 5,0:11:14.46,0:11:16.06,Main,,0,0,0,,Estamos perto, Yuu-san!
Dialogue: 5,0:11:20.92,0:11:22.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Obrigado.
Dialogue: 5,0:11:23.02,0:11:24.25,Main,,0,0,0,,Por vir.
Dialogue: 5,0:11:25.10,0:11:29.76,Main,,0,0,0,,O tenente-coronel disse que éramos uma família.
Dialogue: 5,0:11:30.24,0:11:32.92,Main,,0,0,0,,E que devíamos pôr nossas \Nvidas em risco por essa família.
Dialogue: 5,0:11:35.52,0:11:36.37,Main,,0,0,0,,Idiota.
Dialogue: 5,0:11:37.59,0:11:39.17,Main,,0,0,0,,Ele disse aquilo também, lembra?
Dialogue: 5,0:11:39.93,0:11:41.41,Main,,0,0,0,,Não lembro, não.
Dialogue: 5,0:11:43.31,0:11:44.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Lá está.
Dialogue: 5,0:11:44.46,0:11:46.20,Main,,0,0,0,,Parque Central de Shinjuku!
Dialogue: 5,0:12:03.07,0:12:04.30,Main,,0,0,0,,Yoichi, atrás de você!
Dialogue: 5,0:12:07.80,0:12:08.93,Main,,0,0,0,,Merda!
Dialogue: 5,0:12:31.19,0:12:35.58,Main,,0,0,0,,É claro que tudo vai acabar em merda\N sem aquele imbecil e a tampinha.
Dialogue: 5,0:12:35.58,0:12:37.79,Main,,0,0,0,,Porque não podemos nos reunir em formação.
Dialogue: 5,0:12:43.00,0:12:43.80,Main,,0,0,0,,Aí vem eles!
Dialogue: 5,0:12:48.20,0:12:49.80,Main,,0,0,0,,Não me subestime!
Dialogue: 5,0:12:50.11,0:12:51.30,Main,,0,0,0,,Kimizuki, atrás de você!
Dialogue: 5,0:12:52.49,0:12:53.31,Main,,0,0,0,,Morra!
Dialogue: 5,0:12:57.41,0:12:58.43,Main,,0,0,0,,Yuu-kun!
Dialogue: 5,0:12:58.43,0:12:59.44,Main,,0,0,0,,Yuu?
Dialogue: 5,0:13:04.14,0:13:07.45,Main,,0,0,0,,Olhos no inimigo, Mii-chan.
Dialogue: 5,0:13:13.82,0:13:15.45,Main,,0,0,0,,Onde estão as tropas inimigas?
Dialogue: 5,0:13:16.73,0:13:18.03,Main,,0,0,0,,Não tem mais nenhuma.
Dialogue: 5,0:13:18.03,0:13:20.08,Main,,0,0,0,,O que você matou agora era o último.
Dialogue: 5,0:13:30.72,0:13:33.91,Main,,0,0,0,,Caramba, pessoal!\NQue demais!
Dialogue: 5,0:13:34.93,0:13:37.80,Main,,0,0,0,,Até que não.\NApenas sou melhor do que você.
Dialogue: 5,0:13:37.80,0:13:40.56,Main,,0,0,0,,E?\NO que está fazendo?
Dialogue: 5,0:13:40.56,0:13:41.77,Main,,0,0,0,,Como assim?
Dialogue: 5,0:13:41.77,0:13:46.50,Main,,0,0,0,,Fiquei sabendo que vocês estavam\N em apuros, então vim resgatá-los.
Dialogue: 5,0:13:46.50,0:13:47.74,Main,,0,0,0,,Como se precisássemos disso.
Dialogue: 5,0:13:47.74,0:13:51.71,Main,,0,0,0,,Bem, a missão era a gente se\N reagrupar na linha de defesa.
Dialogue: 5,0:13:52.31,0:13:53.71,Main,,0,0,0,,Você quem disse.
Dialogue: 5,0:13:54.54,0:13:55.91,Main,,0,0,0,,Sei disso.
Dialogue: 5,0:13:56.54,0:13:57.57,Main,,0,0,0,,Sei disso, mas...
Dialogue: 5,0:13:58.12,0:13:59.60,Main,,0,0,0,,Mas o quê?
Dialogue: 5,0:13:59.60,0:14:04.31,Main,,0,0,0,,Pensou mesmo que morreríamos tão facilmente?
Dialogue: 5,0:14:07.52,0:14:09.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Acredite mais na gente.
Dialogue: 5,0:14:16.25,0:14:17.26,Main,,0,0,0,,Sim, eu entendo.
Dialogue: 5,0:14:17.96,0:14:18.66,Main,,0,0,0,,Sinto muito.
Dialogue: 5,0:14:19.63,0:14:22.52,Main,,0,0,0,,Se sente muito, então não faça de novo.
Dialogue: 5,0:14:23.12,0:14:24.02,Main,,0,0,0,,Vamos.
Dialogue: 5,0:14:24.87,0:14:29.40,Main,,0,0,0,,Mas se a mesma coisa acontecer\N amanhã, eu virei de novo.
Dialogue: 5,0:14:31.74,0:14:33.55,Main,,0,0,0,,Estava me ouvindo?
Dialogue: 5,0:14:34.30,0:14:37.03,Main,,0,0,0,,Não me entenda errado.\NEu confio em vocês.
Dialogue: 5,0:14:37.03,0:14:38.66,Main,,0,0,0,,Mas virei mesmo assim.
Dialogue: 5,0:14:40.55,0:14:42.35,Main,,0,0,0,,Amanhã, depois de amanhã,
Dialogue: 5,0:14:42.35,0:14:43.66,Main,,0,0,0,,e para sempre.
Dialogue: 5,0:14:45.76,0:14:50.30,Main,,0,0,0,,Me esqueci de que você tem \Num caso sério de idiotice.
Dialogue: 5,0:14:50.30,0:14:53.73,Main,,0,0,0,,Não gaste saliva, Kimizuki.
Dialogue: 5,0:14:53.73,0:14:55.55,Main,,0,0,0,,Idiotice é algo sem conserto.
Dialogue: 5,0:14:55.92,0:14:59.35,Main,,0,0,0,,Na verdade, quanto mais você fala,\N mais estúpido ele fica.
Dialogue: 5,0:14:59.35,0:15:00.80,Main,,0,0,0,,Qual é, pessoal!
Dialogue: 5,0:15:00.80,0:15:02.01,Main,,0,0,0,,Acalmem-se.
Dialogue: 5,0:15:08.13,0:15:09.82,Main,,0,0,0,,Pois bem.
Dialogue: 5,0:15:10.32,0:15:13.57,Main,,0,0,0,,Já que a chuva passou, vamos indo?
Dialogue: 5,0:15:15.12,0:15:16.82,Main,,0,0,0,,Agora que nós cinco estamos aqui.
Dialogue: 5,0:15:18.28,0:15:19.15,Main,,0,0,0,,Yuu-san.
Dialogue: 5,0:15:20.30,0:15:21.99,Main,,0,0,0,,Certo, vamos nessa!
Dialogue: 5,0:15:21.99,0:15:24.61,Main,,0,0,0,,Eu vou acabar com todos \Naqueles vampiros malditos!
Dialogue: 5,0:16:10.15,0:16:12.83,Main,,0,0,0,,Olha, o que temos aqui?
Dialogue: 5,0:16:12.83,0:16:14.27,Main,,0,0,0,,Você é incrível.
Dialogue: 5,0:16:14.99,0:16:16.15,Main,,0,0,0,,Sou?
Dialogue: 5,0:16:16.15,0:16:17.77,Main,,0,0,0,,Queria poder dizer o mesmo de você.
Dialogue: 5,0:16:22.85,0:16:25.28,Main,,0,0,0,,Detonar: Feitiço Fudou Myou-Ou.
Dialogue: 5,0:16:45.85,0:16:49.05,Main,,0,0,0,,Conseguiu desviar daquilo?\NDá um tempo.
Dialogue: 5,0:16:49.05,0:16:51.13,Main,,0,0,0,,A explosão foi muito lenta.
Dialogue: 5,0:16:51.13,0:16:55.56,Main,,0,0,0,,Além do mais, você esperava mesmo que um feitiço\N velho daqueles funcionasse contra vampiros?
Dialogue: 5,0:16:57.47,0:16:59.57,Main,,0,0,0,,Você nunca desaponta, Mika-kun.
Dialogue: 5,0:17:00.19,0:17:03.22,Main,,0,0,0,,Poder e arrogância transbordantes.
Dialogue: 5,0:17:03.22,0:17:06.58,Main,,0,0,0,,Mas se não tomar cuidado, essa\N arrogância será a sua queda.
Dialogue: 5,0:17:07.21,0:17:08.32,Main,,0,0,0,,Devo ajudá-lo?
Dialogue: 5,0:17:09.62,0:17:11.46,Main,,0,0,0,,O que está dizendo?
Dialogue: 5,0:17:11.46,0:17:13.10,Main,,0,0,0,,Como eu poderia perder?
Dialogue: 5,0:17:13.10,0:17:15.33,Main,,0,0,0,,Como eu disse: tenha cuidado.
Dialogue: 5,0:17:17.18,0:17:20.34,Main,,0,0,0,,Eles nunca pretenderam lutar\N contra você de um para um.
Dialogue: 5,0:17:20.83,0:17:22.58,Main,,0,0,0,,Eles perceberam, Shigure.
Dialogue: 5,0:17:22.58,0:17:23.34,Main,,0,0,0,,Mate-os.
Dialogue: 5,0:17:23.34,0:17:24.42,Main,,0,0,0,,Certo.
Dialogue: 5,0:17:34.22,0:17:36.23,Main,,0,0,0,,Goshi, é com você.
Dialogue: 5,0:17:37.71,0:17:39.18,Main,,0,0,0,,Estou bem à frente de você.
Dialogue: 5,0:17:50.49,0:17:53.45,Main,,0,0,0,,Cheque-mate, vampiro!
Dialogue: 5,0:18:00.13,0:18:01.77,Main,,0,0,0,,Certo, Mika-chan.
Dialogue: 5,0:18:01.77,0:18:03.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Agora você me deve uma.
Dialogue: 5,0:18:15.75,0:18:20.77,Main,,0,0,0,,Parece que estamos em apuros agora.
Dialogue: 5,0:18:21.67,0:18:26.49,Main,,0,0,0,,Aquele vampiro de cabelo \Nprateado é incrivelmente forte.
Dialogue: 5,0:18:26.98,0:18:28.78,Main,,0,0,0,,Escute, Mika-kun.
Dialogue: 5,0:18:28.78,0:18:31.76,Main,,0,0,0,,Não subestime os humanos.
Dialogue: 5,0:18:31.76,0:18:36.03,Main,,0,0,0,,Eles são gananciosos, astutos e tenazes.
Dialogue: 5,0:18:36.03,0:18:40.23,Main,,0,0,0,,Mas, bem, dizer isso para um ex-humano é meio estranho.
Dialogue: 5,0:18:40.23,0:18:40.87,Main,,0,0,0,,Cale a boca.
Dialogue: 5,0:18:42.51,0:18:45.95,Main,,0,0,0,,Que tal levarmos isso a sério agora?
Dialogue: 5,0:18:45.95,0:18:47.27,Main,,0,0,0,,Se ambos trabalharmos juntos—
Dialogue: 5,0:18:47.27,0:18:48.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Não preciso de você.
Dialogue: 5,0:18:49.77,0:18:51.99,Main,,0,0,0,,Sei quais são as táticas deles.
Dialogue: 5,0:18:54.12,0:18:56.77,Main,,0,0,0,,Espada, beba mais do meu sangue.
Dialogue: 5,0:18:58.75,0:19:00.49,Main,,0,0,0,,O que foi que eu te disse?
Dialogue: 5,0:19:00.49,0:19:05.27,Main,,0,0,0,,Essa arrogância vem do seu status\N de alguém que já foi humano?
Dialogue: 5,0:19:17.62,0:19:20.54,Main,,0,0,0,,Parece que precisarei de uma \Nsegunda pílula para esses caras.
Dialogue: 5,0:19:21.11,0:19:22.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Não, Guren-sama!
Dialogue: 5,0:19:22.96,0:19:25.04,Main,,0,0,0,,Você não deve desviar a atenção.
Dialogue: 5,0:19:25.04,0:19:26.63,Main,,0,0,0,,Você também não.
Dialogue: 5,0:19:34.32,0:19:36.72,Main,,0,0,0,,Olha, você é boa.
Dialogue: 5,0:19:37.40,0:19:39.19,Main,,0,0,0,,Por favor, não faça isso, Guren-sama.
Dialogue: 5,0:19:39.19,0:19:41.98,Main,,0,0,0,,Você pode morrer se tomar mais de uma pílula!
Dialogue: 5,0:19:42.86,0:19:45.98,Main,,0,0,0,,E vou morrer com certeza se não tomar!
Dialogue: 5,0:19:46.39,0:19:51.24,Main,,0,0,0,,De qualquer forma, temos que acabar\N com eles antes do efeito passar.
Dialogue: 5,0:19:51.76,0:19:53.81,Main,,0,0,0,,Acabou de conversar?
Dialogue: 5,0:19:53.81,0:19:55.65,Main,,0,0,0,,Porque estou indo atrás de você.
Dialogue: 5,0:19:55.65,0:19:58.03,Main,,0,0,0,,Nossa, obrigado pela educação.
Dialogue: 5,0:19:58.03,0:20:00.75,Main,,0,0,0,,Mas será que poderia nos dar mais um tempinho?
Dialogue: 5,0:20:00.75,0:20:01.75,Main,,0,0,0,,Quanto tempo mais?
Dialogue: 5,0:20:01.75,0:20:06.75,Main,,0,0,0,,Precisamos tomar nossa medicação, então se\N puder calar a boca por vinte segundos, eu—
Dialogue: 5,0:20:10.46,0:20:13.32,Main,,0,0,0,,Sim, foi o que eu pensei.
Dialogue: 5,0:20:13.32,0:20:17.18,Main,,0,0,0,,Sem mencionar que está mais forte do que antes.
Dialogue: 5,0:20:17.18,0:20:20.02,Main,,0,0,0,,Não estou mais me segurando.
Dialogue: 5,0:20:22.46,0:20:24.38,Main,,0,0,0,,Se segurando no campo de batalha?
Dialogue: 5,0:20:24.38,0:20:25.77,Main,,0,0,0,,Muito infantil, não acha?
Dialogue: 5,0:20:26.44,0:20:29.44,Main,,0,0,0,,Não quando essa mesma criança\N está prestes a te matar.
Dialogue: 5,0:20:36.42,0:20:37.49,Main,,0,0,0,,Droga.
Dialogue: 5,0:20:38.06,0:20:39.45,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Parece que é o fim da linha.
Dialogue: 5,0:20:44.89,0:20:47.45,Main,,0,0,0,,Reforços inimigos avistados.
Dialogue: 5,0:20:47.45,0:20:50.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Mika-chan, é melhor acabar com isso rápido.
Dialogue: 5,0:20:57.46,0:20:59.89,Main,,0,0,0,,Droga!\NO tenente-coronel Guren!
Dialogue: 5,0:20:59.89,0:21:01.72,Main,,0,0,0,,Pessoal, tomem uma pílula!
Dialogue: 5,0:21:02.41,0:21:04.73,Main,,0,0,0,,Vamos resgatar o tenente-coronel e nos retirar!
Dialogue: 5,0:21:06.73,0:21:07.53,Main,,0,0,0,,Vamos lá!
Dialogue: 5,0:21:10.70,0:21:12.73,Main,,0,0,0,,Acabou, humano.
Dialogue: 5,0:21:13.76,0:21:14.69,Main,,0,0,0,,Seu maldito.
Dialogue: 5,0:21:17.88,0:21:19.32,Main,,0,0,0,,Guren!
Dialogue: 5,0:21:29.04,0:21:30.44,Main,,0,0,0,,Saia...
Dialogue: 5,0:21:30.44,0:21:32.75,Main,,0,0,0,,Saia de perto do Guren!
Dialogue: 5,0:21:35.78,0:21:38.48,Main,,0,0,0,,Mais um humano...
Dialogue: 5,0:21:38.48,0:21:40.26,Main,,0,0,0,,Mas que incômodo.
Dialogue: 5,0:21:42.17,0:21:44.27,Main,,0,0,0,,Y-Yuu-chan?
Dialogue: 5,0:23:35.02,0:23:37.21,Main,,0,0,0,,No próximo episódio de\N{\i1}Owari no Seraph{\i0}:
Dialogue: 5,0:23:37.87,0:23:39.73,Main,,0,0,0,,"Reunião de infância".
